OL,3,ANo more rice grains in Kellogg's Rice
OL,4,AKrispies due to changing weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FBreakfast cereal giant Kellogg's has
OL,7,Fstopped using rice grains in Rice
OL,8,FKrispies and Coco Pops in the UK due to
OL,9,F"changing weather conditions" that have
OL,10,Fdisrupted supplies.
OL,12,FCorn flour and rice flour are being
OL,13,Fused instead, a Kellogg's spokesperson
OL,14,Fsaid on Tuesday, adding that the
OL,15,Fupdated recipes have been "carefully
OL,16,Fassessed" and the firm has taken
OL,17,Fcustomer feedback into consideration.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
