OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ANo more rice grains in Kellogg's Rice
OL,4,AKrispies due to changing weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FThose ingredients are replacing rice
OL,7,Fgrains as crops have been hit by dry
OL,8,Fweather in key producing countries in
OL,9,FAsia, reducing harvests and driving up
OL,10,Fprices.
OL,12,FThe new recipes mean cereal packaging
OL,13,Fwill now include a 'contains wheat
OL,14,Fgluten' warning.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
